+/* R&C patch 2173: chunk submits split an open ZPASS query into host segments (pure bookkeeping, no D3D12).
+ *
+ * Patch 2029 submits the walker's list every LD_SUBMIT_CHUNK draws so the GPU runs behind the walker, but it refused
+ * while an occlusion query was open: D3D12 needs Begin and End in one list, and a query split in two made patch 2025
